flowchart TD
    Start([Gratuity Claim Filed before Controlling Authority]) --> RegClaim[Register Gratuity Claim<br/>POST /Gratuity/Create -> GRA_CASES]
    
    RegClaim --> CAHearing[Controlling Authority Proceedings & Calculations]
    CAHearing --> CAAward[Controlling Authority Passes Award]

    CAAward --> EnterParams[Enter Audit Calculation Parameters<br/>Principal Gratuity Amount, Due Date, Deposit Date, Deductions]

    EnterParams --> GratuityCalcSvc[Invoke GratuityCalculator Service]

    subgraph InterestFormula ["Statutory 10% Simple Interest Formula (Gratuity Act 1972)"]
        DaysCalc["Calculate Elapsed Days:<br/>Days = (DepositDate - DueDate).Days"]
        Formula["Interest = (Principal * 10 * Days) / (365 * 100)"]
        Deductions["Net Payable = (Principal + Interest) - StatutoryDeductions - PreviousDisbursements"]
        DaysCalc --> Formula
        Formula --> Deductions
    end

    GratuityCalcSvc --> DaysCalc

    Deductions --> SaveAudit[Save Computation Audit Record<br/>POST /Gratuity/AuditCalculation -> tbl_Gratuity_Interest]
    
    SaveAudit --> CorporationAppealCheck{Does Corporation Appeal to Appellate Authority?}
    
    CorporationAppealCheck -- Yes --> FileAppellate[Deposit 100% with Appellate Authority<br/>POST /Gratuity/ClaimantAppeals -> Track PGA / Appeal]
    FileAppellate --> AppellateOrder[Appellate Authority Confirms / Modifies Award]

    CorporationAppealCheck -- No --> DisburseClaimant[Disburse Gratuity & Statutory Interest to Employee]
    AppellateOrder --> DisburseClaimant

    DisburseClaimant --> End([Gratuity Case Closed & Audited])
